    "description": "Boxing owns an immutable typed value. Variant To Data extracts one envelope only when its type specimen matches exactly; it must not route I64 through F64.\n\nBoxing owns an immutable typed value. Variant To Data extracts one envelope only when its type specimen matches exactly; it must not route I64 through F64.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: studio.native.composed@1.\nExpected:\nresult (i64) = 9007199254740993\n",
